  m_Text: 'AR Solar. System Explorer is an educational augmented. reality application
    developed as part of AVR 604: AR and VR Development in Unity at Westcliff University.


    The
    application combines interactive. 3D content with augmented reality to provide
    users with an engaging way to explore the Solar System. Users can detect physical
    surfaces, place a virtual Solar System in their environment, and interact with
    planets and other

    celestial objects.'
